[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4712402653","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120331#issuecomment-4712402653","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120331","id":4712402653,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGOGO3Q","user":{"login":"NoeLoisil","id":113386260,"node_id":"U_kgDOBsIjFA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/113386260?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoeLoisil","html_url":"https://github.com/NoeLoisil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoeLoisil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoeLoisil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoeLoisil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoeLoisil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoeLoisil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoeLoisil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoeLoisil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoeLoisil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoeLoisil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-15T21:01:17Z","updated_at":"2026-06-15T21:22:25Z","body":"After some tracing, it seems like it is due to InvokeGodotClassMethod and HasGodotClassMethod taking a long time.\nIf I have to guess probably scanning the entire c# class each time to check for a _Process function with a StringName.Equal.\nThe issue seems to be worse with inheritance as Godot calls these methods once for each subclass.\nOn top with the collection, bottom with _Process.\n<img width=\"1637\" height=\"622\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/41b76e0e-c11d-4a71-85ce-153563e80917\" />","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4712402653/reactio